91,31]],"links":[["Dawes County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/nebraska/dawes-county"],["ARC or PLC in Dawes County","/arc-plc/nebraska/dawes-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Dawes County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 66% of normal in January to February and 126% in September to October. Every grid listed had its driest year in 2012, and grid 27107 got down to 41% of normal in 2012.</p>"}
